# Patches applied on top of Debian's kernel source, in order (quilt format).
#
# The series is intentionally empty. Debian's source already carries the
# out-of-tree hardening changes SHADOW wants (for example the perf_event_open
# restriction and the Secure Boot lockdown integration), and everything else
# SHADOW changes is configuration. A patch is added here only when it meets the
# policy in docs/kernel/patches.md: it fixes or hardens something that
# configuration cannot, it is small enough to re-review at every stable
# update, and it has been submitted upstream or is not upstreamable for a
# stated reason.
